  "answer_text": "To log into your **PreLicenseTraining.com (PLT)** account, use the official login portals below depending on your account type:\n\n* **[Student Login Portal](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/login)**  \n  Use this link if you are a student taking insurance pre-licensing or continuing education (CE) courses. \n  * *Note:* Your login name is typically the **email address** you registered with, unless you manually changed it in your profile settings.\n\n* **[Mentor / Recruiter Login Portal](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/mentor/login)**  \n  Use this link if you are a mentor, recruiter, manager, or company administrator tracking student progress and scores.\n\n---\n\n### Troubleshooting & Recovery Support\n\nIf you are having trouble logging into your account, you can use the following options:\n\n* **[Forgot Your Password?](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/forgot_password)**  \n  If you don't remember your password, go to this page and enter your registered email address or your mobile phone number to receive reset instructions.\n* **[Forgot Your Login Name?](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/forgot_login)**  \n  If you forgot your username/login name, you can recover it by entering your registered email and password, or by entering your legal First Name, Last Name, and password. \n\n### Customer Support\nIf you still cannot log in or need direct assistance, you can contact the PreLicenseTraining customer service team:\n* **Phone:** 1 (800) 780-2113\n* **Support Page:** [Contact PLT Support](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/contact)",
